WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.097 --> 00:00:05.901
ONE G.O.P. MEMBER OF THE PANEL

00:00:03.632 --> 00:00:06.936
IS ALREADY OFF THE RESERVATION.

00:00:06.035 --> 00:00:07.369
HERE'S CORRESPONDED

00:00:07.069 --> 00:00:09.138
DOUG McKELWAY.

00:00:07.503 --> 00:00:10.072
&gt;&gt; WE LOOKED AT IT THOROUGHLY.

00:00:09.271 --> 00:00:11.540
WE INTERVIEWED NEARLY EVERYBODY

00:00:10.206 --> 00:00:13.309
AND WE DIDN'T FIND ANY COLLUSION

00:00:11.674 --> 00:00:16.745
WITH THE RUSSIANS.

00:00:13.442 --> 00:00:18.514
&gt;&gt; AFTER 14 MONTHS OF INTERVIEWS

00:00:16.879 --> 00:00:19.348
AND REVIEWING INTELLIGENCE,

00:00:18.647 --> 00:00:20.149
REPUBLICANS ON THE HOUSE

00:00:19.482 --> 00:00:22.485
INTELLIGENCE COMMITTEE ANNOUNCED

00:00:20.282 --> 00:00:24.987
THEIR WORK IS DONE WITH A

00:00:22.618 --> 00:00:29.225
FINDING OF NO RUSSIAN COLLUSION.

00:00:25.121 --> 00:00:32.194
SENATE DEMOCRATS WERE SURPRISED

00:00:29.358 --> 00:00:32.595
BY THE RELEASE, THEY LAMBASTED

00:00:32.328 --> 00:00:36.499
THE AUTHORS.

00:00:32.728 --> 00:00:38.467
&gt;&gt; CHAIRMAN NUNES AND

00:00:36.632 --> 00:00:39.201
REPRESENTATIVE CONAWAY CUT OFF

00:00:38.601 --> 00:00:40.569
THE INVESTIGATION, BURIED THEIR

00:00:39.335 --> 00:00:45.107
HEADS IN THE SAND AND WROTE A

00:00:40.703 --> 00:00:46.742
REPORT THAT CONTRADICTS 17

00:00:45.241 --> 00:00:48.110
INTELLIGENCE AGENCIES AND AN

00:00:46.876 --> 00:00:49.545
INDICTMENT FROM SPECIAL COUNSEL

00:00:48.244 --> 00:00:49.979
MUELLER SHOWS WHERE THEIR

00:00:49.678 --> 00:00:55.151
LOYALTIES LIE.

00:00:50.112 --> 00:00:58.921
&gt;&gt; DEMOCRATS -- REPUBLICAN SAID

00:00:55.284 --> 00:01:01.157
THERE WAS A RUSSIAN ATTEMPT.

00:00:59.054 --> 00:01:03.125
&gt;&gt; THERE WAS EFFORTS TO TRY TO

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:05.194
HURT HILLARY AND HELP TRUMP.

00:01:03.259 --> 00:01:06.762
&gt;&gt; HE ADDED A STICK RELATION.

00:01:05.327 --> 00:01:09.398
I THINK THERE WAS THE OPPOSITE.

00:01:06.896 --> 00:01:14.069
&gt;&gt; WHILE THE PRESIDENT CHEERED

00:01:09.532 --> 00:01:16.138
THE FINDINGS, -- &gt;&gt; WE ARE HAPPY

00:01:14.203 --> 00:01:20.543
WITH THE HOUSE INTELLIGENCE

00:01:16.272 --> 00:01:22.945
COMMITTEE.

00:01:20.676 --> 00:01:24.513
IT WAS A VERY POWERFUL DECISION.

00:01:23.078 --> 00:01:25.948
&gt;&gt; HOUSE INTELLIGENCE COMMITTEE

00:01:24.647 --> 00:01:29.118
DEMOCRATS VOWING TO KEEP LOOKING

00:01:26.081 --> 00:01:30.553
FOR RUSSIAN COLLUSION.

00:01:29.251 --> 00:01:30.986
&gt;&gt; WE WILL CONTINUE TO DO THE

00:01:30.686 --> 00:01:32.788
INVESTIGATION.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:33.255
WE HAVE NEVER HAD THE POWER TO

00:01:32.922 --> 00:01:35.224
CALL WITNESSES.

00:01:33.389 --> 00:01:37.893
&gt;&gt; THE REAL ACTION TURNS TO THE

00:01:35.357 --> 00:01:38.928
SENATE WHERE TWO COMMITTEES

00:01:38.027 --> 00:01:39.929
CONTINUE THEIR OWN

00:01:39.061 --> 00:01:40.963
INVESTIGATIONS OF COLLUSION.

00:01:40.062 --> 00:01:44.767
AT A PACE THAT HAS THE PARTIES

00:01:41.096 --> 00:01:45.367
AT ODDS.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:49.505
&gt;&gt; BLUNTLY THE JUDICIARY

00:01:45.501 --> 00:01:51.173
COMMITTEE INVESTIGATION HAS BEEN

00:01:49.638 --> 00:01:52.975
PAINFULLY AND GLACIALLY SLOW.

00:01:51.307 --> 00:01:54.310
&gt;&gt; THE ONLY COLLUSION

00:01:53.108 --> 00:01:56.078
INVESTIGATION APPEARS ANY AND

00:01:54.443 --> 00:01:57.546
FROM THE HYPERPARTISAN INFLUENCE

00:01:56.212 --> 00:01:59.415
OF THIS ELECTION YEAR IS ONE

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:01.317
BEING UNDERTAKEN BY THE JUSTICE

00:01:59.548 --> 00:02:02.718
DEPARTMENT AS VECTOR GENERAL.

